      en: ["Founded in 1405 as a secondary royal palace", "Most well-preserved of the Joseon palaces", "Features the world-famous Huwon (Secret Garden)", "UNESCO World Heritage site since 1997", "Served as the primary seat of government for 250 years", "Landscape covers about 110 acres of land"],
